e](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/readwise) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/readwise)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/readwise)` |\n| [**Crimson Crab Mcp Template**](https://github.com/singhpratech/crimson-crab-mcp-template) | @singhpratech | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/crimson-crab-mcp-template) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/crimson-crab-mcp-template)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/crimson-crab-mcp-template)` |\n| [**Pluggedin Mcp Proxy**](https://github.com/VeriTeknik/pluggedin-mcp-proxy) | @VeriTeknik | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/pluggedin-mcp-proxy) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/pluggedin-mcp-proxy)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/pluggedin-mcp-proxy)` |\n| [**Craft Docs Nested Notes MCP**](https://github.com/craftdocs/mcp-server-craft) | @craftdocs | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/craft-docs) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/craft-docs)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/craft-docs)` |\n| [**Metatool App MCP**](https://github.com/metatool-ai/metatool-app) | @metatool-ai | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/metatool-app) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/metatool-app)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/metatool-app)` |\n| [**Alderpost MCP**](https://github.com/8randonpickart5/alderpost-mcp) | @8randonpickart5 | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/alderpost-mcp) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/alderpost-mcp)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/alderpost-mcp)` |\n| [**Open Task Relay Public MCP**](https://github.com/lanekingsbery/open-task-relay-public) | @lanekingsbery | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/open-task-relay-public) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/open-task-relay-public)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/open-task-relay-public)` |\n| [**Agy Bridge MCP**](https://github.com/sshahzaiib/agy-bridge) | 